# Temporary/lock files created by Windows/Excel (hex names like EC231400, 8494D220)
01_data/01_input/[0-9A-F][0-9A-F][0-9A-F][0-9A-F][0-9A-F][0-9A-F][0-9A-F][0-9A-F]

